---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Create With Soumay | AI Prompts & Creator Resources"
  description="Learn about Create With Soumay, a creator-focused platform offering practical AI image prompts, Instagram resources, creative ideas, and helpful guides."
  active=""
>

<section class="hero hero-compact">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">About Create With Soumay</div>

    <h1>
      Helping creators turn
      <span class="gradient-text">ideas into content.</span>
    </h1>

    <p>
      Create With Soumay is a creator-focused platform built to make
      AI-assisted creativity and content creation simpler, more practical,
      and easier to explore.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>What is Create With Soumay?</h2>

      <p>
        Create With Soumay is an independent online resource for creators,
        students, designers, social media users, and anyone interested in
        using AI tools for creative projects.
      </p>

      <p>
        The platform brings together ready-to-use AI image prompts, creative
        ideas, Instagram resources, practical guides, and educational
        articles in one searchable place.
      </p>

      <p>
        Our aim is simple: reduce the time spent figuring out what to write,
        where to start, or how to structure a creative workflow, so visitors
        can focus more on creating.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>What you'll find here</h2>

      <p>
        Create With Soumay is organized around practical resources that can
        be used as starting points for real creative projects.
      </p>

      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>AI Image Prompts</strong> — detailed, copy-ready prompts
          designed for different visual concepts, styles, and creative
          scenarios.
        </li>

        <li>
          <strong>Creator Resources</strong> — useful resources and ideas for
          people creating content for Instagram and other social platforms.
        </li>

        <li>
          <strong>Creative Guides</strong> — straightforward articles covering
          AI-assisted creativity, content creation, and practical workflows.
        </li>

        <li>
          <strong>Ideas & Inspiration</strong> — concepts that can help
          creators experiment with new visual and content formats.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Our approach</h2>

      <p>
        We believe useful creator resources should be easy to understand and
        easy to use. That is why Create With Soumay focuses on clear
        explanations, practical examples, searchable content, and
        copy-ready resources rather than unnecessary complexity.
      </p>

      <p>
        AI-generated content can produce very different results depending on
        the tool, model, settings, and instructions being used. Our prompts
        are intended as creative starting points and may require
        experimentation or adjustment for a particular AI tool.
      </p>

      <p>
        We continuously work to expand the library and improve existing
        resources so visitors can find more useful information over time.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Built for creators</h2>

      <p>
        Create With Soumay is designed for people at different stages of
        their creative journey. Whether you are experimenting with AI image
        generation for the first time, looking for a new visual concept, or
        trying to improve your social media content workflow, the platform
        provides resources that are designed to help you move from an idea
        to an actionable starting point.
      </p>

      <p>
        We value simplicity, usefulness, originality, and a good user
        experience. Those principles guide how new resources are created and
        how existing content is organized.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Our commitment to visitors</h2>

      <p>
        We want Create With Soumay to remain a useful and trustworthy
        resource. We aim to provide original, practical content and clearly
        communicate the purpose of the resources published on the website.
      </p>

      <p>
        Some AI tools, platforms, products, or services mentioned on this
        website may be operated by third parties. Create With Soumay is not
        responsible for changes to third-party tools, pricing, availability,
        features, or policies. Visitors should always check the official
        source for the latest information before relying on a third-party
        service.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Why Create With Soumay?</h2>

      <p>
        There are countless AI tools and creator resources available online,
        but finding a useful prompt or a clear starting point can still take
        time. Create With Soumay was created around that problem: bringing
        practical creative resources together in a simple, accessible
        platform.
      </p>

      <p>
        The website will continue evolving as new AI capabilities, creator
        trends, and content formats emerge.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Get in touch</h2>

      <p>
        Have a question, suggestion, correction, or collaboration idea?
        We'd love to hear from you.
      </p>

      <p>
        Visit our contact page to get in touch with the Create With Soumay
        team.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>
